#: ../../src/tcp.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_tcp_t` --- TCP handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_tcp_t` —— TCP 句柄"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:7
msgid "TCP handles are used to represent both TCP streams and servers."
msgstr "TCP 句柄既用于表示 TCP 流，也用于表示服务器。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:9
msgid ":c:type:`uv_tcp_t` is a 'subclass' of :c:type:`uv_stream_t`."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_tcp_t` 是 :c:type:`uv_stream_t` 的“子类”。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:13
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:17
msgid "TCP handle type."
msgstr "TCP 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:21
msgid "Flags used in :c:func:`uv_tcp_bind`."
msgstr "在 :c:func:`uv_tcp_bind` 中使用的标志。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:43
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:45
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:47
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_stream_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_stream_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:51
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:55
msgid "Initialize the handle. No socket is created as of yet."
msgstr "初始化句柄。此时尚未创建套接字。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:59
msgid ""
"Initialize the handle with the specified flags. At the moment only the "
"lower 8 bits of the `flags` parameter are used as the socket domain. A "
"socket will be created for the given domain. If the specified domain is "
"``AF_UNSPEC`` no socket is created, just like :c:func:`uv_tcp_init`."
msgstr "以指定的标志初始化句柄。目前 `flags` 参数只有低 8 位被用作套接字域。会为给定的域创建套接字。如果指定的域是 ``AF_UNSPEC``，则不会创建套接字，与 :c:func:`uv_tcp_init` 一样。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:68
msgid "Open an existing file descriptor or SOCKET as a TCP handle."
msgstr "将现有的文件描述符或 SOCKET 作为 TCP 句柄打开。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:70
msgid "the file descriptor is set to non-blocking mode."
msgstr "文件描述符被设置为非阻塞模式。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:73
msgid ""
"The passed file descriptor or SOCKET is not checked for its type, but "
"it's required that it represents a valid stream socket."
msgstr "不会检查传入的文件描述符或 SOCKET 的类型，但要求它表示一个有效的流套接字。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:78
msgid "Enable `TCP_NODELAY`, which disables Nagle's algorithm."
msgstr "启用 `TCP_NODELAY`，即禁用 Nagle 算法。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:82
msgid ""
"Enable / disable TCP keep-alive. `delay` is the initial delay in seconds,"
" ignored when `enable` is zero."
msgstr "启用/禁用 TCP keep-alive。`delay` 是以秒为单位的初始延迟，当 `enable` 为零时忽略。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:85
msgid ""
"After `delay` has been reached, 10 successive probes, each spaced 1 "
"second from the previous one, will still happen. If the connection is "
"still lost at the end of this procedure, then the handle is destroyed "
"with a ``UV_ETIMEDOUT`` error passed to the corresponding callback."
msgstr "在达到 `delay` 之后，仍会发生 10 次连续探测，每次与前一次相隔 1 秒。如果在此流程结束时连接仍然丢失，则该句柄会被销毁，并向相应的回调传递 ``UV_ETIMEDOUT`` 错误。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:90
msgid "If `delay` is less than 1 then ``UV_EINVAL`` is returned."
msgstr "若 `delay` 小于 1，则返回 ``UV_EINVAL``。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:92
msgid "If `delay` is less than 1 then ``UV_EINVAL``` is returned."
msgstr "若 `delay` 小于 1，则返回 ``UV_EINVAL```。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:96
msgid ""
"Enable / disable TCP keep-alive with all socket options: `TCP_KEEPIDLE`, "
"`TCP_KEEPINTVL` and `TCP_KEEPCNT`. `idle` is the value for "
"`TCP_KEEPIDLE`, `intvl` is the value for `TCP_KEEPINTVL`, `cnt` is the "
"value for `TCP_KEEPCNT`, ignored when `on` is zero."
msgstr "启用/禁用 TCP keep-alive 并设置全部套接字选项：`TCP_KEEPIDLE`、`TCP_KEEPINTVL` 和 `TCP_KEEPCNT`。`idle` 是 `TCP_KEEPIDLE` 的值，`intvl` 是 `TCP_KEEPINTVL` 的值，`cnt` 是 `TCP_KEEPCNT` 的值，当 `on` 为零时忽略。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:100
msgid ""
"With TCP keep-alive enabled, `idle` is the time (in seconds) the "
"connection needs to remain idle before TCP starts sending keep-alive "
"probes. `intvl` is the time (in seconds) between individual keep-alive "
"probes. TCP will drop the connection after sending `cnt` probes without "
"getting any replies from the peer, then the handle is destroyed with a "
"``UV_ETIMEDOUT`` error passed to the corresponding callback."
msgstr "在启用 TCP keep-alive 的情况下，`idle` 是 TCP 开始发送 keep-alive 探测之前连接需要保持空闲的时间（以秒为单位）。`intvl` 是各次 keep-alive 探测之间的间隔时间（以秒为单位）。TCP 会在发送 `cnt` 次探测且未从对端收到任何应答后断开连接，随后该句柄会被销毁，并向相应的回调传递 ``UV_ETIMEDOUT`` 错误。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:105
msgid ""
"If one of `idle`, `intvl`, or `cnt` is less than 1, ``UV_EINVAL`` is "
"returned."
msgstr "若 `idle`、`intvl` 或 `cnt` 中任一小于 1，则返回 ``UV_EINVAL``。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:107
msgid "added support of setting `TCP_KEEPINTVL` and `TCP_KEEPCNT` socket options."
msgstr "新增了设置 `TCP_KEEPINTVL` 和 `TCP_KEEPCNT` 套接字选项的支持。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:110
msgid ""
"Ensure that the socket options are supported by the underlying operating "
"system. Currently supported platforms:"
msgstr "请确保底层操作系统支持这些套接字选项。当前支持的平台："

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:112
msgid "AIX"
msgstr "AIX"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:113
msgid "DragonFlyBSD"
msgstr "DragonFlyBSD"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:114
msgid "FreeBSD"
msgstr "FreeBSD"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:115
msgid "illumos"
msgstr "illumos"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:116
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:117
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:118
msgid "NetBSD"
msgstr "NetBSD"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:119
msgid "Solaris"
msgstr "Solaris"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:120
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:124
msgid ""
"Enable / disable simultaneous asynchronous accept requests that are "
"queued by the operating system when listening for new TCP connections."
msgstr "启用/禁用监听新 TCP 连接时由操作系统排队的并发异步接受请求。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:127
msgid ""
"This setting is used to tune a TCP server for the desired performance. "
"Having simultaneous accepts can significantly improve the rate of "
"accepting connections (which is why it is enabled by default) but may "
"lead to uneven load distribution in multi-process setups."
msgstr "此设置用于将 TCP 服务器调优至所需的性能。并发接受可以显著提高接受连接的速率（这也是默认启用它的原因），但在多进程部署中可能导致负载分布不均。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:134
msgid "Bind the handle to an address and port."
msgstr "将句柄绑定到地址和端口。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:136
msgid ""
"When the port is already taken, you can expect to see an "
"``UV_EADDRINUSE`` error from :c:func:`uv_listen` or "
":c:func:`uv_tcp_connect` unless you specify ``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT`` in "
"`flags` for all the binding sockets. That is, a successful call to this "
"function does not guarantee that the call to :c:func:`uv_listen` or "
":c:func:`uv_tcp_connect` will succeed as well."
msgstr "当端口已被占用时，可以预期会从 :c:func:`uv_listen` 或 :c:func:`uv_tcp_connect` 收到 ``UV_EADDRINUSE`` 错误，除非在 `flags` 中为所有绑定的套接字均指定 ``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT``。也就是说，对此函数的成功调用并不能保证对 :c:func:`uv_listen` 或 :c:func:`uv_tcp_connect` 的调用也会成功。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:142
msgid "TCP handle. It should have been initialized with :c:func:`uv_tcp_init`."
msgstr "TCP 句柄。它应当已经通过 :c:func:`uv_tcp_init` 完成初始化。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:144
msgid ""
"Address to bind to. It should point to an initialized ``struct "
"sockaddr_in`` or ``struct sockaddr_in6``."
msgstr "要绑定到的地址。它应指向已初始化的 ``struct sockaddr_in`` 或 ``struct sockaddr_in6``。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:147
msgid ""
"Flags that control the behavior of binding the socket. "
"``UV_TCP_IPV6ONLY`` can be contained in `flags` to disable dual-stack "
"support and only use IPv6. ``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT`` can be contained in "
"`flags` to enable the socket option `SO_REUSEPORT` with the capability of"
" load balancing that distribute incoming connections across all listening"
" sockets in multiple processes or threads."
msgstr "控制套接字绑定行为的标志。`flags` 中可以包含 ``UV_TCP_IPV6ONLY``，用于禁用双栈支持、仅使用 IPv6。`flags` 中可以包含 ``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT``，用于启用套接字选项 `SO_REUSEPORT`，从而具备负载均衡能力，将传入连接分发到多个进程或线程中的所有监听套接字上。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:154
msgid "0 on success, or an error code < 0 on failure."
msgstr "成功时返回 0，失败时返回小于 0 的错误码。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:156
msgid "added the ``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT`` flag."
msgstr "新增了 ``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT`` 标志。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:159
msgid ""
"``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT`` flag is available only on Linux 3.9+, DragonFlyBSD "
"3.6+, FreeBSD 12.0+, Solaris 11.4, and AIX 7.2.5+ at the moment. On other"
" platforms this function will return an UV_ENOTSUP error."
msgstr "目前 ``UV_TCP_REUSEPORT`` 标志仅在 Linux 3.9+、DragonFlyBSD 3.6+、FreeBSD 12.0+、Solaris 11.4 和 AIX 7.2.5+ 上可用。在其他平台上，此函数将返回 UV_ENOTSUP 错误。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:165
msgid ""
"Get the current address to which the handle is bound. `name` must point "
"to a valid and big enough chunk of memory, ``struct sockaddr_storage`` is"
" recommended for IPv4 and IPv6 support."
msgstr "获取句柄当前绑定到的地址。`name` 必须指向一块有效且足够大的内存，推荐使用 ``struct sockaddr_storage`` 以支持 IPv4 和 IPv6。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:171
msgid ""
"Get the address of the peer connected to the handle. `name` must point to"
" a valid and big enough chunk of memory, ``struct sockaddr_storage`` is "
"recommended for IPv4 and IPv6 support."
msgstr "获取连接到该句柄的对端地址。`name` 必须指向一块有效且足够大的内存，推荐使用 ``struct sockaddr_storage`` 以支持 IPv4 和 IPv6。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:177
msgid ""
"Establish an IPv4 or IPv6 TCP connection. Provide an initialized TCP "
"handle and an uninitialized :c:type:`uv_connect_t`. `addr` should point "
"to an initialized ``struct sockaddr_in`` or ``struct sockaddr_in6``."
msgstr "建立 IPv4 或 IPv6 TCP 连接。提供已初始化的 TCP 句柄和未初始化的 :c:type:`uv_connect_t`。`addr` 应指向已初始化的 ``struct sockaddr_in`` 或 ``struct sockaddr_in6``。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:181
msgid ""
"On Windows if the `addr` is initialized to point to an unspecified "
"address (``0.0.0.0`` or ``::``) it will be changed to point to "
"``localhost``. This is done to match the behavior of Linux systems."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，如果 `addr` 被初始化为指向未指定地址（``0.0.0.0`` 或 ``::``），它将被改为指向 ``localhost``。这样做是为了与 Linux 系统的行为保持一致。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:185
msgid ""
"The callback is made when the connection has been established or when a "
"connection error happened."
msgstr "回调会在连接已建立或发生连接错误时被调用。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:188
msgid "added ``0.0.0.0`` and ``::`` to ``localhost`` mapping"
msgstr "新增了 ``0.0.0.0`` 和 ``::`` 到 ``localhost`` 的映射"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:191
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_stream_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_stream_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:195
msgid ""
"Resets a TCP connection by sending a RST packet. This is accomplished by "
"setting the `SO_LINGER` socket option with a linger interval of zero and "
"then calling :c:func:`uv_close`. Due to some platform inconsistencies, "
"mixing of :c:func:`uv_shutdown` and :c:func:`uv_tcp_close_reset` calls is"
" not allowed."
msgstr "通过发送 RST 包重置 TCP 连接。这是通过将 `SO_LINGER` 套接字选项设置为 linger 间隔为零，然后调用 :c:func:`uv_close` 来实现的。由于某些平台行为不一致，不允许混合调用 :c:func:`uv_shutdown` 与 :c:func:`uv_tcp_close_reset`。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:205
msgid ""
"Create a pair of connected sockets with the specified properties. The "
"resulting handles can be passed to `uv_tcp_open`, used with `uv_spawn`, "
"or for any other purpose."
msgstr "创建一对具有指定属性的已连接套接字。所得的句柄可以传给 `uv_tcp_open`、与 `uv_spawn` 一起使用，或用于任何其他目的。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:209
msgid "Valid values for `flags0` and `flags1` are:"
msgstr "`flags0` 和 `flags1` 的有效取值为："

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:211
msgid ""
"UV_NONBLOCK_PIPE: Opens the specified socket handle for `OVERLAPPED` or "
"`FIONBIO`/`O_NONBLOCK` I/O usage. This is recommended for handles that "
"will be used by libuv, and not usually recommended otherwise."
msgstr "UV_NONBLOCK_PIPE：为 `OVERLAPPED` 或 `FIONBIO`/`O_NONBLOCK` I/O 用途打开指定的套接字句柄。建议对将被 libuv 使用的句柄采用此选项，其他情况通常不建议。"

#: ../../src/tcp.rst:216
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`socketpair(2)` with a domain of AF_UNIX."
msgstr "等价于使用 AF_UNIX 域的 :man:`socketpair(2)`。"

